(5624757, 816584, 27161, '<td valign="top">First, I love this photo, but I have to say it is getting a lower vote than I would normally give.  I simply can''t see the rule of thirds here.  Your major subject seems to be the tiger.  If it only took up 2/3 or 1/3 of the screen I could justify, but the only thing I see here is his eye, which is not the subject just a part of it.</td>', 'First, I love this photo, but I have to say it is getting a lower vote than I would normally give.  I simply can''t see the rule of thirds here.  Your major subject seems to be the tiger.  If it only took up 2/3 or 1/3 of the screen I could justify, but the only thing I see here is his eye, which is not the subject just a part of it.', '2009-08-26 11:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
