(5624822, 816395, 109649, '<td valign="top">I very much like the angle and the color tone... very different from pretty much every other "spider web" picture I have seen.  Bravo!</td>', 'I very much like the angle and the color tone... very different from pretty much every other "spider web" picture I have seen.  Bravo!', '2009-08-26 11:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624824, 815602, 109541, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture, nice lines, good lighting control.</td>', 'Interesting capture, nice lines, good lighting control.', '2009-08-26 11:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624847, 816404, 101445, '<td valign="top">For me the rule of thirds says to put the main subject at one of the third locations, either vertically or horizontally. The main subject in your image to me is the tower which is centrally located. I am guessing that its the ill-defined horizon  that is in the third position so I guess it still qualifies. I would be interested in seeing if the image was better if the horizon was kept in vertical third position and the tower was moved to the horizontal third picture.</td>', 'For me the rule of thirds says to put the main subject at one of the third locations, either vertically or horizontally. The main subject in your image to me is the tower which is centrally located. I am guessing that its the ill-defined horizon  that is in the third position so I guess it still qualifies. I would be interested in seeing if the image was better if the horizon was kept in vertical third position and the tower was moved to the horizontal third picture.', '2009-08-26 12:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624871, 815807, 57447, '<td valign="top">Your shot really stand out and fits the challenge.</td>', 'Your shot really stand out and fits the challenge.', '2009-08-26 12:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624872, 816878, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice close up, maybe a little dark, but I don''t see how this illustrates the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Nice close up, maybe a little dark, but I don''t see how this illustrates the rule of thirds.', '2009-08-26 12:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624877, 816426, 57447, '<td valign="top">Great example of rule of thirds.  I might have tried a filter on my camera or some saturation in PP to lessen the slightly overexposed look.  Score - 7</td>', 'Great example of rule of thirds.  I might have tried a filter on my camera or some saturation in PP to lessen the slightly overexposed look.  Score - 7', '2009-08-26 12:30:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624879, 816549, 57447, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits rule of thirds!</td>', 'Definitely fits rule of thirds!', '2009-08-26 12:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624880, 816100, 57447, '<td valign="top">Fits rule of thirds well and a good shot!</td>', 'Fits rule of thirds well and a good shot!', '2009-08-26 12:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624882, 816810, 57447, '<td valign="top">Outstanding.</td>', 'Outstanding.', '2009-08-26 12:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624890, 816582, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo. But for this challenge, the focal point seems quite centered rather than on one of the four power points of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo. But for this challenge, the focal point seems quite centered rather than on one of the four power points of the rule of thirds.', '2009-08-26 12:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624895, 816477, 80458, '<td valign="top">i dont think this is proper use of thirds. nice photo and clarity though.</td>', 'i dont think this is proper use of thirds. nice photo and clarity though.', '2009-08-26 12:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624896, 816570, 47761, '<td valign="top">How Lovely! My favorite light of the day.</td>', 'How Lovely! My favorite light of the day.', '2009-08-26 12:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624897, 816917, 80458, '<td valign="top">the placement of the woman and the horizon work well for Rule of Thirds - but the silhouette barge ruins the effect.</td>', 'the placement of the woman and the horizon work well for Rule of Thirds - but the silhouette barge ruins the effect.', '2009-08-26 12:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624899, 815631, 80458, '<td valign="top">this really DNMC.  nothing appears to be aligned on the third and the part that is in focus is in the middle.</td>', 'this really DNMC.  nothing appears to be aligned on the third and the part that is in focus is in the middle.', '2009-08-26 12:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624900, 815624, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wish there was a little more ... a focal point object on one of those intersections.</td>', 'Wish there was a little more ... a focal point object on one of those intersections.', '2009-08-26 12:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624901, 815401, 80458, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  a little busy for my taste.</td>', 'cool shot.  a little busy for my taste.', '2009-08-26 12:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624902, 816558, 80458, '<td valign="top">i wish you would''ve cropped out the gray clouds on the top - would''ve helped for your rule of thirds.</td>', 'i wish you would''ve cropped out the gray clouds on the top - would''ve helped for your rule of thirds.', '2009-08-26 12:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624903, 816864, 80458, '<td valign="top">stunning.</td>', 'stunning.', '2009-08-26 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624904, 816679, 80458, '<td valign="top">great abstract!</td>', 'great abstract!', '2009-08-26 12:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624906, 815812, 66384, '<td valign="top">Charming. A little over-sharpened perhaps, but outstanding none the less.</td>', 'Charming. A little over-sharpened perhaps, but outstanding none the less.', '2009-08-26 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624910, 815865, 66384, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if the horizon was level.</td>', 'I would like this better if the horizon was level.', '2009-08-26 12:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624915, 816810, 66384, '<td valign="top">Very graceful and good example of rule of thirds. Great capture. I wish there was more color in those colorful birds. Still this is outstanding.</td>', 'Very graceful and good example of rule of thirds. Great capture. I wish there was more color in those colorful birds. Still this is outstanding.', '2009-08-26 13:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624916, 816785, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love this one. Especially the color and geometry. Wonderful image and perfectly composed for this challenge.</td>', 'Love this one. Especially the color and geometry. Wonderful image and perfectly composed for this challenge.', '2009-08-26 13:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624917, 816397, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good composition.</td>', 'Nice colors and good composition.', '2009-08-26 13:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624920, 816865, 66384, '<td valign="top">Wow. Amazing bug, and wonderful clarity and color.</td>', 'Wow. Amazing bug, and wonderful clarity and color.', '2009-08-26 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624926, 816679, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and geometry.</td>', 'Beautiful light and geometry.', '2009-08-26 13:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624928, 816005, 66384, '<td valign="top">looks upside down, but nice simple composition. I think it would benefit from having the focal point on one of the intersections of the thirds ... a little more to the right and up a bit.</td>', 'looks upside down, but nice simple composition. I think it would benefit from having the focal point on one of the intersections of the thirds ... a little more to the right and up a bit.', '2009-08-26 13:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624936, 816368, 46918, '<td valign="top">I definately like what you are trying for. The masque is a pretty good subject, however, I believe that the doorway is too bright. A lot of the detail is missing..</td>', 'I definately like what you are trying for. The masque is a pretty good subject, however, I believe that the doorway is too bright. A lot of the detail is missing..', '2009-08-26 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624941, 816607, 46918, '<td valign="top">Good shot... I really like the subject too.</td>', 'Good shot... I really like the subject too.', '2009-08-26 13:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624943, 816811, 46918, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the gargoyle. All I have to ask is did you put the flag there or was it already there.</td>', 'Great shot of the gargoyle. All I have to ask is did you put the flag there or was it already there.', '2009-08-26 13:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624948, 816689, 19035, '<td valign="top">Excellent Composition.</td>', 'Excellent Composition.', '2009-08-26 13:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624950, 816543, 49109, '<td valign="top">very subtle use of ROT, like it</td>', 'very subtle use of ROT, like it', '2009-08-26 13:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624965, 816725, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice. 9</td>', 'Very nice. 9', '2009-08-26 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624968, 816711, 104230, '<td valign="top">Wonderful details and composition.</td>', 'Wonderful details and composition.', '2009-08-26 13:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624971, 816851, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. I love it.</td>', 'This is really nice. I love it.', '2009-08-26 13:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5624982, 816512, 104230, '<td valign="top">Delightful image, and very well composed.</td>', 'Delightful image, and very well composed.', '2009-08-26 14:03:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625010, 816911, 10785, '<td valign="top">Awesome DoF, Focus and Sharpness. The eyes on this owl are amazing except for the yellow reflections. I can be open to the option you put the eyes in the top third of the photo, however this composition is more fill the frame.</td>', 'Awesome DoF, Focus and Sharpness. The eyes on this owl are amazing except for the yellow reflections. I can be open to the option you put the eyes in the top third of the photo, however this composition is more fill the frame.', '2009-08-26 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625012, 816363, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good concept but the sticks don''t quite look in focus. The light spot is very harsh and the left side of the photo is cut off.</td>', 'Good concept but the sticks don''t quite look in focus. The light spot is very harsh and the left side of the photo is cut off.', '2009-08-26 14:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625021, 816478, 109583, '<td valign="top">I would have brought the light up a bit.  Stunning composition.</td>', 'I would have brought the light up a bit.  Stunning composition.', '2009-08-26 14:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625028, 816703, 109583, '<td valign="top">I love the way the grass texture is brought out (did you increase the contrast?)</td>', 'I love the way the grass texture is brought out (did you increase the contrast?)', '2009-08-26 14:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625030, 815988, 109583, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  It looks as if he climbed up :)</td>', 'Very nice composition.  It looks as if he climbed up :)', '2009-08-26 14:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625032, 815824, 109583, '<td valign="top">This has a bit of an element of surprise, as if the flower is taller than the buildings.  I like that.</td>', 'This has a bit of an element of surprise, as if the flower is taller than the buildings.  I like that.', '2009-08-26 14:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625038, 816922, 109583, '<td valign="top">Is it true that taking pictures of the sun will damage the camera sensor?  Did you take precautions of some kind?  Very nice shot.  The faint kite line is what makes it.</td>', 'Is it true that taking pictures of the sun will damage the camera sensor?  Did you take precautions of some kind?  Very nice shot.  The faint kite line is what makes it.', '2009-08-26 14:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625049, 815989, 109583, '<td valign="top">Many of the rule of thirds compositions are less creative than this one.  Thank you!</td>', 'Many of the rule of thirds compositions are less creative than this one.  Thank you!', '2009-08-26 14:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625053, 816905, 109583, '<td valign="top">Nicre creative composition!</td>', 'Nicre creative composition!', '2009-08-26 14:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625057, 816880, 109583, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  too bad his eye was hidden by the fence</td>', 'nice idea.  too bad his eye was hidden by the fence', '2009-08-26 15:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625060, 816864, 109583, '<td valign="top">very nice creative composition!</td>', 'very nice creative composition!', '2009-08-26 15:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625063, 816395, 109583, '<td valign="top">after seeing hte same composition over and over, this is so refreshing to the eye.  beautiful!</td>', 'after seeing hte same composition over and over, this is so refreshing to the eye.  beautiful!', '2009-08-26 15:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625068, 816818, 109583, '<td valign="top">is the faded effect intentional to the subject matter?  I really like the composition.  Comical.  Great!</td>', 'is the faded effect intentional to the subject matter?  I really like the composition.  Comical.  Great!', '2009-08-26 15:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625075, 816498, 109583, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of oonventionally pretty flower macro shots, but this one stands out because of the contrast and colour.  Far from being softened with a tight focal plane, it''s almost gritty in detail, like an electron microscope picture.  I love it.</td>', 'There are a lot of oonventionally pretty flower macro shots, but this one stands out because of the contrast and colour.  Far from being softened with a tight focal plane, it''s almost gritty in detail, like an electron microscope picture.  I love it.', '2009-08-26 15:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625077, 816679, 109583, '<td valign="top">You can hardly tell what it is at first!</td>', 'You can hardly tell what it is at first!', '2009-08-26 15:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625147, 816392, 104230, '<td valign="top">IMO the strong line between the trees and sky, placed nearly in the center of the image, detracts from a feeling of thirds.  Might have worked better if cropped differently.</td>', 'IMO the strong line between the trees and sky, placed nearly in the center of the image, detracts from a feeling of thirds.  Might have worked better if cropped differently.', '2009-08-26 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625167, 816369, 84779, '<td valign="top">kinda creapy</td>', 'kinda creapy', '2009-08-26 16:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625184, 816368, 104518, '<td valign="top">The bright white light pulled my eye away from the blue</td>', 'The bright white light pulled my eye away from the blue', '2009-08-26 16:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625186, 816731, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice shot overall...I do wish you''d have taken some off the top to allow the comp to fit ROT''s a little better.</td>', 'Nice shot overall...I do wish you''d have taken some off the top to allow the comp to fit ROT''s a little better.', '2009-08-26 16:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625188, 816925, 104518, '<td valign="top">The flame gets lost on the stick</td>', 'The flame gets lost on the stick', '2009-08-26 16:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625189, 816549, 30049, '<td valign="top">Topaz?  Seems heavily processed.</td>', 'Topaz?  Seems heavily processed.', '2009-08-26 16:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625190, 816705, 104518, '<td valign="top">I followed his gaze</td>', 'I followed his gaze', '2009-08-26 16:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625192, 816584, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m so glad you told me where to look with that title...I''d have NEVER found the main subject or ROT point.  :P</td>', 'I''m so glad you told me where to look with that title...I''d have NEVER found the main subject or ROT point.  :P', '2009-08-26 16:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625194, 816916, 104518, '<td valign="top">The bird isn''t at any of the intersections.</td>', 'The bird isn''t at any of the intersections.', '2009-08-26 16:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625196, 816477, 104518, '<td valign="top">Found my eye wandering from place to place. Intriguing.</td>', 'Found my eye wandering from place to place. Intriguing.', '2009-08-26 16:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625197, 816537, 104518, '<td valign="top">Trite but well done.</td>', 'Trite but well done.', '2009-08-26 16:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625204, 816811, 104518, '<td valign="top">Yes, the chimera is on the right third and does occupy space along the bottom third, but I expected my eye to alight on something special at an intersection.  Really liked the shape, empty space and its color, and the color contrast with the flag.</td>', 'Yes, the chimera is on the right third and does occupy space along the bottom third, but I expected my eye to alight on something special at an intersection.  Really liked the shape, empty space and its color, and the color contrast with the flag.', '2009-08-26 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625209, 816911, 104518, '<td valign="top">The upper right intersection seems to hit him between the eyes.  His left eye (on our right) really looks fierce.</td>', 'The upper right intersection seems to hit him between the eyes.  His left eye (on our right) really looks fierce.', '2009-08-26 17:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625211, 816303, 104518, '<td valign="top">Probably my fault, but my eye went to the screw first.  The title moved my eye on to the arrow.</td>', 'Probably my fault, but my eye went to the screw first.  The title moved my eye on to the arrow.', '2009-08-26 17:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625214, 816915, 104518, '<td valign="top">My eye was drawn to the biggest white, which isn''t in the thirds.</td>', 'My eye was drawn to the biggest white, which isn''t in the thirds.', '2009-08-26 17:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625216, 816653, 104518, '<td valign="top">My eye went to what looks like a sound hole, and only later went to the pearl inlay.</td>', 'My eye went to what looks like a sound hole, and only later went to the pearl inlay.', '2009-08-26 17:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625217, 815624, 108349, '<td valign="top">i''ll give you a four, and NOTHING more</td>', 'i''ll give you a four, and NOTHING more', '2009-08-26 17:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625219, 816392, 104518, '<td valign="top">The boat gets lost in the cliffs, but does the thirds thing.</td>', 'The boat gets lost in the cliffs, but does the thirds thing.', '2009-08-26 17:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625221, 816105, 104518, '<td valign="top">My eye was drawn to the ferrule, which isn''t at an intersection.</td>', 'My eye was drawn to the ferrule, which isn''t at an intersection.', '2009-08-26 17:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625222, 816557, 108580, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture, damn shame about the power/phone lines...</td>', 'Lovely capture, damn shame about the power/phone lines...', '2009-08-26 17:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625224, 816923, 104518, '<td valign="top">The standing fisherman''s head is close to an intersection.</td>', 'The standing fisherman''s head is close to an intersection.', '2009-08-26 17:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625226, 816744, 104518, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape, well framed, nice reflection, but where is the thirds?</td>', 'Lovely landscape, well framed, nice reflection, but where is the thirds?', '2009-08-26 17:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625228, 816321, 104518, '<td valign="top">Quite moody. Makes you wonder what they''re sneaking ashore. My eye went straight for the boat in the lower right intersection.</td>', 'Quite moody. Makes you wonder what they''re sneaking ashore. My eye went straight for the boat in the lower right intersection.', '2009-08-26 17:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625237, 816810, 104518, '<td valign="top">They are feisty critters. Could you have cropped it so that the eye of each bird was at an intersection?</td>', 'They are feisty critters. Could you have cropped it so that the eye of each bird was at an intersection?', '2009-08-26 17:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625238, 816526, 104518, '<td valign="top">Not my thing, but you did a great job with it.</td>', 'Not my thing, but you did a great job with it.', '2009-08-26 17:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625239, 816810, 108580, '<td valign="top">Breathtaking, 10</td>', 'Breathtaking, 10', '2009-08-26 17:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625245, 815490, 104518, '<td valign="top">Thought the bugger (get it?) was going to jump right off my screen.  Good job.</td>', 'Thought the bugger (get it?) was going to jump right off my screen.  Good job.', '2009-08-26 17:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625251, 816429, 104518, '<td valign="top">We sent her to a mummery.  The glove was a little high and to the left.</td>', 'We sent her to a mummery.  The glove was a little high and to the left.', '2009-08-26 17:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625253, 816851, 104518, '<td valign="top">Like the sepia. Would expect the boy to be higher or lower.</td>', 'Like the sepia. Would expect the boy to be higher or lower.', '2009-08-26 17:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625256, 816891, 104518, '<td valign="top">Or maybe "Rule of three divided into two". Liked the colors and texture.</td>', 'Or maybe "Rule of three divided into two". Liked the colors and texture.', '2009-08-26 17:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625258, 816778, 104518, '<td valign="top">In Texas we would call that a lazy M...  Nice outline.</td>', 'In Texas we would call that a lazy M...  Nice outline.', '2009-08-26 17:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625261, 816363, 104518, '<td valign="top">This is almost redundundant.  The glare bothered me by not being at an intersection.</td>', 'This is almost redundundant.  The glare bothered me by not being at an intersection.', '2009-08-26 17:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625264, 816164, 104518, '<td valign="top">Like the sharpness of the subjects with the blur of the background.</td>', 'Like the sharpness of the subjects with the blur of the background.', '2009-08-26 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625267, 816469, 104518, '<td valign="top">The dark green pulls my eye out of the picture, but it does start in the right place.</td>', 'The dark green pulls my eye out of the picture, but it does start in the right place.', '2009-08-26 17:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625269, 816662, 104518, '<td valign="top">It''s like he''s translucent. Nice.</td>', 'It''s like he''s translucent. Nice.', '2009-08-26 17:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625277, 816478, 46918, '<td valign="top">Ya gotta love the Bald Eagle. Very majestic and powerful bird...Good shot</td>', 'Ya gotta love the Bald Eagle. Very majestic and powerful bird...Good shot', '2009-08-26 17:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625292, 815873, 104518, '<td valign="top">Nice look on the face.  Are those new spikes?  My eye was drawn to the base and his face. Base is below the third, face is above.</td>', 'Nice look on the face.  Are those new spikes?  My eye was drawn to the base and his face. Base is below the third, face is above.', '2009-08-26 17:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625293, 816725, 15711, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the grin this gave me.  I needed that today. :8)</td>', 'Thanks for the grin this gave me.  I needed that today. :8)', '2009-08-26 18:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625294, 816557, 104518, '<td valign="top">She was here a minute ago, I''ll tell her you''re looking for her.  Really like the detail on the bird and the blurred background.</td>', 'She was here a minute ago, I''ll tell her you''re looking for her.  Really like the detail on the bird and the blurred background.', '2009-08-26 18:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625295, 816715, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the reflections, didn''t see any point of interest at the intersections.</td>', 'Liked the reflections, didn''t see any point of interest at the intersections.', '2009-08-26 18:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625296, 816607, 15711, '<td valign="top">I smiled when I saw this.</td>', 'I smiled when I saw this.', '2009-08-26 18:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625298, 815602, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked the simplicity. Assumed the intersection was upper right, then saw that the leaf pointed right at the lower right.  Good job.</td>', 'Liked the simplicity. Assumed the intersection was upper right, then saw that the leaf pointed right at the lower right.  Good job.', '2009-08-26 18:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625299, 816810, 15711, '<td valign="top">The rule of thirds is great, including both of the little guys.  I love the stop motion of the higher one''w wings.  That background almost beige is funky for me.  I think black and white would have really been the way to go. :~)</td>', 'The rule of thirds is great, including both of the little guys.  I love the stop motion of the higher one''w wings.  That background almost beige is funky for me.  I think black and white would have really been the way to go. :~)', '2009-08-26 18:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625300, 816584, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like how he blends into the background.  The whiskers seem a touch over sharpened.</td>', 'I like how he blends into the background.  The whiskers seem a touch over sharpened.', '2009-08-26 18:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625301, 816100, 104518, '<td valign="top">Liked all the whites with just a touch of pink.</td>', 'Liked all the whites with just a touch of pink.', '2009-08-26 18:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625302, 816727, 104518, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for old cars, but that grill is awfully close to the center.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for old cars, but that grill is awfully close to the center.', '2009-08-26 18:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5625303, 816391, 104518, '<td valign="top">I''m thinking of painting my house those colors.  Think Home Depot can match them?</td>', 'I''m thinking of painting my house those colors.  Think Home Depot can match them?', '2009-08-26 18:11:27.000000', NULL, 1);
