(5629456, 816924, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seemed a little lacking in something that my eye was trying to pull out of it, so I looked at the image properties. Your file sizer of 42k indicates a lot of JPEG compression. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit</td>', 'Seemed a little lacking in something that my eye was trying to pull out of it, so I looked at the image properties. Your file sizer of 42k indicates a lot of JPEG compression. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit', '2009-08-31 13:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
