(5629465, 816785, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a little soft somehow. You file size of only 39k indicates heavy JPEG compression. I think this is the problem. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit.<br/> <br/>The way the person is half hidden behind the column is interesting, however. It seems to work in an odd, OOTB manner.</td>', 'Seems a little soft somehow. You file size of only 39k indicates heavy JPEG compression. I think this is the problem. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit. The way the person is half hidden behind the column is interesting, however. It seems to work in an odd, OOTB manner.', '2009-08-31 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
