(5629470, 815358, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I also think you could have squeezed a bit more detail into this if you''d used less compression when you saved it. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit</td>', 'I like this, but I also think you could have squeezed a bit more detail into this if you''d used less compression when you saved it. Compression kills detail. Always use the least amount of compression that you can and still fit it under the challenge limit', '2009-08-31 14:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
