(5629474, 815969, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grass comes of as WAYYYYY oversaturated. It''s not actually the green component however. When I see this in my own shots, I turn down saturation on the yellow channel. Yellow is often a heavier component in foliage shots than green is.</td>', 'Grass comes of as WAYYYYY oversaturated. It''s not actually the green component however. When I see this in my own shots, I turn down saturation on the yellow channel. Yellow is often a heavier component in foliage shots than green is.', '2009-08-31 14:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
