(5631071, 815966, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely calm mood created here an d I get the sense of a deserted beach..lost island feeling to it. im not shure that the blown sky does it for me. The branch helps to draw the attention down though to the beach and sand with rock. As my eye then goes down...im missing something there to hold my attention. Still like the lines of water and shore created here as framed. 6</td>', 'Lovely calm mood created here an d I get the sense of a deserted beach..lost island feeling to it. im not shure that the blown sky does it for me. The branch helps to draw the attention down though to the beach and sand with rock. As my eye then goes down...im missing something there to hold my attention. Still like the lines of water and shore created here as framed. 6', '2009-09-01 17:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
