(5631886, 816000, 68504, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favourite in the challenge. Of course there is much to be said for the sheep - they draw you right into the landscape, but the tripartite landscape is wonderfully blended, the blue hues at the top of the range, skywards, and the reddy-brown hues at the bottom, groundwards.</td>', 'I think this is my favourite in the challenge. Of course there is much to be said for the sheep - they draw you right into the landscape, but the tripartite landscape is wonderfully blended, the blue hues at the top of the range, skywards, and the reddy-brown hues at the bottom, groundwards.', '2009-09-02 01:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5631892, 815624, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t come up for me in voting, though I wish it had. I really have no idea how I would have perceived this in voting, but I really like the OOTB thinking.</td>', 'Didn''t come up for me in voting, though I wish it had. I really have no idea how I would have perceived this in voting, but I really like the OOTB thinking.', '2009-09-02 01:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
