(5632569, 816685, 66384, '<td valign="top">It didn''t flop with me. I gave it a high score. I think the image is very well divided on the rule of thirds. The only thing that could have been better for "rule of thirds" would have been to have a focal point, such as the flowers, on one of the intersecting power points. The urn at the end of the hall, and the flowers came close, but weren''t on the mark. But I really like the geometry, rhythm, and light in this image.</td>', 'It didn''t flop with me. I gave it a high score. I think the image is very well divided on the rule of thirds. The only thing that could have been better for "rule of thirds" would have been to have a focal point, such as the flowers, on one of the intersecting power points. The urn at the end of the hall, and the flowers came close, but weren''t on the mark. But I really like the geometry, rhythm, and light in this image.', '2009-09-02 12:36:42.000000', NULL, 0),
