(5633028, 816810, 11793, '<td valign="top">congrats - i know these guys are hard to capture....  well done.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by DrAchoo:</b></div><hr/><i>Playing? :) Don''t you know 90% of the hummingbird language is curse words? They hate each other. But great capture. Congrats on the ribbon.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i was going to say about the same thing, but saw your post.  they will even fight off their own offspring to protect a feeding spot.  i saw one beat the hell out of a butterfly once too.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-09-02 15:39:02.</i></td>', 'congrats - i know these guys are hard to capture....  well done. Originally posted by DrAchoo:Playing? :) Don''t you know 90% of the hummingbird language is curse words? They hate each other. But great capture. Congrats on the ribbon.  i was going to say about the same thing, but saw your post.  they will even fight off their own offspring to protect a feeding spot.  i saw one beat the hell out of a butterfly once too.', '2009-09-02 16:38:21.000000', '2009-09-02 16:39:02.000000', 0),
