(5634683, 816359, 87305, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by briantammy:</b></div><hr/><i> interesting find.  is this in the wild or a private place? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is a public place in Argentina, an artificial lake. The turtles come out at midday, it was the first time I saw them...</td>', 'Originally posted by briantammy: interesting find.  is this in the wild or a private place?   This is a public place in Argentina, an artificial lake. The turtles come out at midday, it was the first time I saw them...', '2009-09-03 15:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
