(5639108, 815761, 772, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club...<br/> <br/>This challenge is one that was rather easy to meet, so that aspect doesn''t play a significant role in the results.  A score of 5.69 is a little better than the 5.37 average of this challenge.<br/> <br/>From my personal perspective, I love images that put shape and texture into the forefront of the composition.  Your image does that rather well obviously due to the choice of subject.  I also tend to like high contrast images, but this one seems to be just a little over the top in that aspect for me.  On the other hand, what this image is lacking for me is some sort of theme that provides a high level of interest for me as the viewer.  There is a good story of off balance and symmetry to go along with the shapes and texture, but it''s just missing something else and I can''t really put my finger on it.  Generally when that becomes a problem, its a simple choice of subject that comes into play.</td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club... This challenge is one that was rather easy to meet, so that aspect doesn''t play a significant role in the results.  A score of 5.69 is a little better than the 5.37 average of this challenge. From my personal perspective, I love images that put shape and texture into the forefront of the composition.  Your image does that rather well obviously due to the choice of subject.  I also tend to like high contrast images, but this one seems to be just a little over the top in that aspect for me.  On the other hand, what this image is lacking for me is some sort of theme that provides a high level of interest for me as the viewer.  There is a good story of off balance and symmetry to go along with the shapes and texture, but it''s just missing something else and I can''t really put my finger on it.  Generally when that becomes a problem, its a simple choice of subject that comes into play.', '2009-09-07 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640435, 816869, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>this is a really nice shot, i like how all the colours compliment each other.  The one thing that I think is hurting this shot is the crop, crop out the brown table to give it more of a flow versus two parts of a shot. having the second earring at an angle towards the center would have given this more drama.  Aldo a little sharper on the main focus earring would have been good too. <br/> <br/>Nice shot!</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.   this is a really nice shot, i like how all the colours compliment each other.  The one thing that I think is hurting this shot is the crop, crop out the brown table to give it more of a flow versus two parts of a shot. having the second earring at an angle towards the center would have given this more drama.  Aldo a little sharper on the main focus earring would have been good too.  Nice shot!', '2009-09-08 12:17:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640448, 815665, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>first impression is that is very dark.  If it werent for your title then I would not know what this was. A little spotlight on the rings would have been good. IT does look sharp and in focus , just a little hard to judge. Good use of rule of thirds</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   first impression is that is very dark.  If it werent for your title then I would not know what this was. A little spotlight on the rings would have been good. IT does look sharp and in focus , just a little hard to judge. Good use of rule of thirds', '2009-09-08 12:31:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640538, 816311, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>wow what a hotel this is, that has to be the largest pool I have ever seen!<br/> <br/>This shot has a slight horizon tilt going on and in the right hand top corner you will see it is also pretty grey.  Some selective colours could have brought out some more of the greens that you have in the sea.  Your sharpeness is good, POV and DOF is good.<br/> <br/>well done<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.   wow what a hotel this is, that has to be the largest pool I have ever seen! This shot has a slight horizon tilt going on and in the right hand top corner you will see it is also pretty grey.  Some selective colours could have brought out some more of the greens that you have in the sea.  Your sharpeness is good, POV and DOF is good. well done ', '2009-09-08 14:09:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640555, 816108, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>This is a lovely family portrait shot.  There are a couple of things here, the shirts are a little blown out and the faces are dark.  Your sharpness is spot on here, your DOF is great and the colours are really good. <br/> <br/>Next time , maybe use a darker shirt and a reflector to bring out the faces a little more. <br/> <br/>this is a lovely family shot that I am sure is treasured</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.   This is a lovely family portrait shot.  There are a couple of things here, the shirts are a little blown out and the faces are dark.  Your sharpness is spot on here, your DOF is great and the colours are really good.  Next time , maybe use a darker shirt and a reflector to bring out the faces a little more.  this is a lovely family shot that I am sure is treasured', '2009-09-08 14:28:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640559, 816593, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>Cool shot!!!!  an added bonus to the soccor match!<br/> <br/>Your rule of thirds is fairly loose as you stated but it is there, kinda.  I think what hurts this shot is the fact that it is 150 and 640.  I am seeign the jaggies in this shot, that could also be the jpeg compression.  It is difficult when you have a great shot and little things like the size hurt it. <br/> <br/>The details that you have are good, sharp  good colours. you have a high ISO but I can not see grain, <br/> <br/>this is a good solid shot<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.   Cool shot!!!!  an added bonus to the soccor match! Your rule of thirds is fairly loose as you stated but it is there, kinda.  I think what hurts this shot is the fact that it is 150 and 640.  I am seeign the jaggies in this shot, that could also be the jpeg compression.  It is difficult when you have a great shot and little things like the size hurt it.  The details that you have are good, sharp  good colours. you have a high ISO but I can not see grain,  this is a good solid shot ', '2009-09-08 14:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640566, 816572, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>Rhino''s always seem so lonely to me in zoo''s adn the mud seems to enhance this affect, so you have a nice powerful image here. <br/> <br/>The focus is not on his head though, it is more along his shoulders.  Try focusing slap bang in the middle of his head so his horns and ears are in focus too. <br/> <br/>In post processing, there is not a lot I can see that you could have done differently. <br/> <br/>Great emotive shot, well done<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have an in depth comment from a member of the Critique Club.   Rhino''s always seem so lonely to me in zoo''s adn the mud seems to enhance this affect, so you have a nice powerful image here.  The focus is not on his head though, it is more along his shoulders.  Try focusing slap bang in the middle of his head so his horns and ears are in focus too.  In post processing, there is not a lot I can see that you could have done differently.  Great emotive shot, well done ', '2009-09-08 14:41:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640775, 816093, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>Very dramitc statue  here<br/> <br/>I would say that your post processing is spot on for this shot, you have the sharpness, clarity and colours very well.  I think what is hurting you with your score is that it is a statue and not a real ''live'' scene. <br/> <br/>This really is a wonderful statue, maybe you could show us the whole statue, i would like to see it</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   Very dramitc statue  here I would say that your post processing is spot on for this shot, you have the sharpness, clarity and colours very well.  I think what is hurting you with your score is that it is a statue and not a real ''live'' scene.  This really is a wonderful statue, maybe you could show us the whole statue, i would like to see it', '2009-09-08 19:23:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640777, 816810, 102315, '<td valign="top">This shot is awesome and the colors are perfect!! Beautiful!!!</td>', 'This shot is awesome and the colors are perfect!! Beautiful!!!', '2009-09-08 19:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5640998, 816810, 8367, '<td valign="top">How wonderful. Great focus and capture! Well done.</td>', 'How wonderful. Great focus and capture! Well done.', '2009-09-08 22:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641018, 815355, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>Interesting shot here.  You sharpness is excellent, you coped with that very well, your ISo was a little high but I fail to see any grain at all, good control there. Your colours are good.  The angle is odd though, this would have done a little better with a less sharp angle, this one is extreme.  The FS record is a classic, but it looks like it was just put there.  When setting up a shot like this, change angles and height. <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   Interesting shot here.  You sharpness is excellent, you coped with that very well, your ISo was a little high but I fail to see any grain at all, good control there. Your colours are good.  The angle is odd though, this would have done a little better with a less sharp angle, this one is extreme.  The FS record is a classic, but it looks like it was just put there.  When setting up a shot like this, change angles and height.  ', '2009-09-08 22:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641024, 816576, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>you have excellent focus here for not having a tripod, your ISO is high, but there is a lack of grain , so you controlled what lighting you did have fairly well. The shot is slightly flat right now though, in post processing adjusting your exposure, brightness and contrast would have given this a boost. <br/> <br/>Great try</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   you have excellent focus here for not having a tripod, your ISO is high, but there is a lack of grain , so you controlled what lighting you did have fairly well. The shot is slightly flat right now though, in post processing adjusting your exposure, brightness and contrast would have given this a boost.  Great try', '2009-09-08 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5641027, 816436, 87808, '<td valign="top">Hi from the Critique Club,<br/> <br/> You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.  <br/> <br/>This is certainly a chilly scene!!  I like how your blues and whites contrast so brightly against each other.  You have a massive tilt going on though in your horizon, this certainly needs to be straighten out as right now it looks like everything is falling off the page or a crop off the top.  <br/> <br/>In post processing, i would suggest a little saturations of cyan and blues just to bring out a more blue look in the water, the bluer the water the colder it will look with this particular shot. <br/> <br/>Good shot</td>', 'Hi from the Critique Club,  You asked for your shot to have a comment from a member of the Critique Club.   This is certainly a chilly scene!!  I like how your blues and whites contrast so brightly against each other.  You have a massive tilt going on though in your horizon, this certainly needs to be straighten out as right now it looks like everything is falling off the page or a crop off the top.   In post processing, i would suggest a little saturations of cyan and blues just to bring out a more blue look in the water, the bluer the water the colder it will look with this particular shot.  Good shot', '2009-09-08 22:42:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(5642202, 816436, 105466, '<td valign="top">Thanks for your commrnts and critique. One thing I feel I have to correct: The edge in the background is not the horizon, but the sloping glacier that feeds the lagoon with ice and if I were to tilt the image so this line were level, the picture would surely look strange.</td>', 'Thanks for your commrnts and critique. One thing I feel I have to correct: The edge in the background is not the horizon, but the sloping glacier that feeds the lagoon with ice and if I were to tilt the image so this line were level, the picture would surely look strange.', '2009-09-09 15:45:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5646849, 816685, 86447, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I ready your comments and I find them more than relatively amusing. <br/> <br/>Hilarious, in fact.   :)    That clear glass is totally cool!<br/> <br/>I gave this a 7.   <br/> <br/></td>', 'LOL!  I ready your comments and I find them more than relatively amusing.  Hilarious, in fact.   :)    That clear glass is totally cool! I gave this a 7.    ', '2009-09-14 16:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
